  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "Security update for util-linux",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for util-linux fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-13595: heap use-after-free read in `libblkid` nested partition probing (bsc#1269583).\n- CVE-2026-27456: TOCTOU race condition in the mount program when setting up loop devices (bsc#1261606).\n- Several security issues in releases prior to v2.42.2 and v2.41.5 (bsc#1268886).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
